<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuania records zero inflation rate in August.</title>
<headline>Lithuania records zero inflation rate in August.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's inflation rate was 0.0 percent in August compared with 0.1 percent in July for a year-on-year rate of 24.3 percent, the country's statistics department said on Friday.</p>
<p>			   Aug 1996	 July 1996	 Aug 1995</p>
<p> Month-on-month (pct)  0.0		   0.1		 0.4</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)   24.3		  24.9		36.1</p>
<p> Index (Dec 93=100)  217.2		 217.2	     174.7</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +3717-22 66 93</p>
</text>
